Package: mt7668-dkms
Version: 2.0.0
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), build-essential
Maintainer: Van der Decken <elsangithub@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: MediaTek MT7668 SDIO Wi-Fi Linux DKMS Driver
 Production-grade, turnkey out-of-tree DKMS driver for MediaTek MT7668
 (SDIO 037a:7608 / 037a:6602) Wi-Fi chipsets on ARM64 Linux kernels (6.x - 6.18+).
 Includes dedicated AP mode (ap0) support for router/hotspot operations,
 Bluetooth conflict isolation, and SDIO shutdown quiesce service for ZTE B860H V5.
